<section id="milestones" class="dashboard-section stats-milestones" aria-labelledby="milestones-heading">
  <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Thresholds crossed over time</p>
      <h2 id="milestones-heading">Milestones</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Instead of another total, this view asks when long-running pursuits crossed meaningful cumulative thresholds—and what comes next.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="stats-milestones__layout">
    <div class="stats-milestones__panel">
      <div class="stats-milestones__panel-head">
        <div><span>Recent history</span><h3>Latest thresholds crossed</h3></div>
        <small>Calculated from the public daily archive</small>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-milestones__timeline" data-milestone-timeline aria-live="polite">
        <p class="stats-milestones__loading">Loading milestone history…</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stats-milestones__panel">
      <div class="stats-milestones__panel-head">
        <div><span>What is next</span><h3>Progress toward the next mark</h3></div>
        <small>Updates with the archive</small>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-milestones__progress-grid" data-milestone-progress aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
